<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!Lead.OwnerFirstName},</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">The Lead&nbsp;</font><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.Name} from {!Lead.Company} has been assigned to you.&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Be sure to follow the "Guidance for success". If this is an Unclaimed Lead be sure to Claim it and start attempting to contact the Lead.</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Click&nbsp;</span><a href="{!Lead.Link}"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">here</font><span style="font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></a><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">to visit this lead record in SFDC</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">If the Lead has been Qualified, be sure to read the notes, PACTT information and activities to familiarize yourself with the Lead.</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Actions upon receipt of this notification:</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">1. Claim the Lead to change sales stage to "Sales Accepted Lead".</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">2. A call or email must be logged within 1 business day of receipt of this notification.</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">3. If contact is established and the lead is considered to have an Opportunity product to enter the Sales Process</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="white-space:pre">		</span>A: Follow the "Search Before Request" to request new Account to be created</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="white-space:pre">		</span>B: After the Account is created, Convert the Lead to an Opportunity on the Account</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">4. If an Opportunity for Sales is not established, disposition the Lead with the proper Sub Status.</span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">If not an opportunity at this time, and if desired, you can convert this lead to a contact for potential contact in the future.</div><div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Leads move to a terminated state if there is no activity for 30 days and 90 days since the creation date.</div><div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div><div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Good Luck!</div></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p></o:p></p><p style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>